{title: Dekha Na Haay Re Socha Na}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Bombay To Goa R D Burman}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C],        Hey dekha na haay re, socha na haay re
[C] [F],        rakh di nishaane pe jaan
[F] [A#],        Kadamo mein tere nikale mera dum,
[C],        hai bas yahi armaan
[C],        Are o u kukadu ku ku
[C],        Dole dole re, dole dole re,
[C] [F],        dole dole ye ye ye
[C],        Mit jaayenge mar jaayenge
[C] [A#],        kaam koyi kar jaayenge
[A#],        Marake bhi chain na mile,
[A#] [C],        toh jaayenge yaaro kaha
[C],        Are o u
[C],        Dekha na haay re....
[C],        Kaatil hai kaun kaha nahi jaaye,
[C] [A#],        chup bhi toh raha nahi jaaye
[A#],        Bulbul hai kaun kaun sayyaad,
[A#] [C],        kuchh toh kaho re meri jaan
[C],        Are o u
[C],        Dekha na haay re....
[C],        Ghar se chale khaake kasam,
[C] [A#],        chhodenge pichha na ham
[A#],        Sar pe kafan baandhe huye,
[A#] [C],        aaya deewaana yaha
[C],        Are o u
[C],        Dekha na haay re....
